<title>USA: American Financial unit executive dies.</title>
<headline>American Financial unit executive dies.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Financial Group Inc said on Friday that Ronald Walker, 59, vice chairman of its Great American Insurance Co subsidiary, died from a cerebral hemorrhage earlier in the week.</p>
<p>Walker has held several positions in American Financial's affiliated companies and servced as president and chief operating officer of American Financial Corp from 1984 until 1995, the company said.</p>
</text>
